    S:written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.0=This Book Contains Information about every Alloy, which can be created by using a Smelting Crucible.¶===================¶In order to make an Alloy you need to reach the Melting Point of the Alloy itself.
    S:written.book.Manual_Alloys.page.1=And you need to reach the Melting Point of all but one of its Components. You can ofcourse also melt all of the Components, but you are free to 'not melt' one of the Components.
